Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ==============================================================================
; Clear Custom Pre-Login Security Notice Banner (Windows 11)
; ==============================================================================
; Requires Administrator privileges (HKLM).
; Clears both LegalNoticeCaption and LegalNoticeText so sign-in proceeds normally.
; ==============================================================================

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Policies\System]
"legalnoticecaption"=""
"legalnoticetext"=""
